WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:02.100
My name is Ziva.

2
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:05.900
I live in Tel Aviv, and I'm really not young anymore.

3
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:10.200
I've had terrible back pain for many years,

4
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:14.200
and I've been through every treatment on the market.

5
00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:23.000
Every kind of physiotherapy, chiropractic included.

6
00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:26.200
There's no method I haven't tried,

7
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:31.000
acupuncture, Feldenkrais, everything.

8
00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:32.800
The relief was very small.

9
00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:38.500
But I was referred here,

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.600
and I drove all the way from Tel Aviv, very skeptical.

11
00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:48.200
After a few treatments, there's a dramatic change.

12
00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:52.000
The pain in my legs is completely gone,

13
00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:55.200
and the back pain isn't yet, but it's on its way.

14
00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:58.600
I'm still in shock,

15
00:00:58.800 --> 00:00:59.400
so we'll see,

16
00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:01.800
but I highly recommend it.
